Cyano3DS

Cyano3DS is a native port of CyanogenMod 7.2 (Android 2.3.7 / API 10) to the
Nintendo 3DS family.  Android runs on the bottom screen and boots as a FIRM
payload on top of the linux-3ds kernel.

